[{"title":"送侄从戎云南兼柬居掾史","author":"胡奎","text":"我祖自南渡，世为盐官人。\n家传安定谱，子孙多搢绅。\n嗟汝英妙年，从戎万里道。\n断蓬离本根，骨肉岂相保。\n忆汝别家曰，妇病在膏肓。\n小妹应门户，两女才倚床。\n一年一得书，见书如见汝。\n蹉跎十五年，阅尽寒与暑。\n昨者奉军帖，仓卒暂还家。\n两女上堂拜，不识去时爷。\n朝纺木棉花，夜织机中布。\n裁为身上衣，梦绕天南路。\n天南有名将，云是汉嫖姚。\n威声振夷夏，勋业著皇朝。\n汝今向前去，勿恋故乡住。\n生入玉门关，会当有奇遇。\n乌啼海东树，落月在城头。\n送汝北郭门，霜花满征裘。\n千金买宝刀，岂若聊城箭。\n鲁连倜傥生，何曾叹贫贱。\n洞庭秋水落，三峡夜猿哀。\n船过瞿唐口，还经滟滪堆。\n严程不可缓，别去关山远。\n缩地恨无方，我肠辘轳转。\n辕门有知己，远惠白象梳。\n琼瑶无以报，为我谢区区。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55753,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送东既白上人之京","author":"胡奎","text":"旭日东方来，起送东既白。\n山笠野云深，田衣江水碧。\n去登千里道，归化三生石。\n鹤羽振高飙，迢迢望飞锡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55754,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送浙江佥宪金台王公考满之京","author":"胡奎","text":"王公希代宝，本自金台人。\n素抱匡济略，华年登要津。\n布衣谒万乘，意气干青云。\n恩承凤凰诏，擢为乌府臣。\n钱唐古都会，一水东西分。\n三年持玉节，远迩劳咨询。\n冰壶贮秋月，藻鉴无纤尘。\n兹焉考嘉绩，封章朝紫宸。\n天子坐南面，视听自下民。\n苟乏耳目官，上天何由闻。\n公今司献纳，一一请具陈。\n某郡山水美，某州风俗淳。\n某守贪以墨，某吏清以仁。\n某田足禾稼，某冶饶金银。\n某灶可淅卤，某营可屯军。\n某曹奸且黠，某士才更文。\n里巷某贞节，岩穴某隐沦。\n忠良荐某辈，淫祀黜某神。\n虎拜伏阙下，正及鸡鸣晨。\n天颜动微笑，孰不荷陶甄。\n维时晴雪后，吴水碧粼粼。\n张帆南斗下，伐木大江滨。\n我亦刍荛者，斐词公勿瞋。\n愿言宣大化，四海回阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55755,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题晓峰","author":"胡奎","text":"在山不见山，出山山更好。\n披衣五更起，山色入门早。\n空翠落琴床，晴光动林表。\n自有天地来，万仞青不了。\n寄言山中人，古今亦昏晓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55756,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送叙班刘南奎还临江省亲","author":"胡奎","text":"日出狮峰顶，鹊鸣庭树枝。\n慈母出门望，儿从天上归。\n一别十三年，母子隔远道。\n不忧岁月深，但恐母年老。\n儿仕大鸿胪，母在高堂居。\n有禄不得养，问安徒寄书。\n儿今乞归省，诏许还乡井。\n暂经洪都门，遥指白云岭。\n一笑偶相逢，论诗铁柱宫。\n相逢即相别，挂席趁回风。\n回风吹五两，南浦春波长。\n就船买鲤鱼，沿月棹歌响。\n登堂进流霞，更栽萱草花。\n百岁母身健，愿儿长在家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55757,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪","author":"胡奎","text":"晴响始鸣条，寒威稍侵户。\n声䋣知杂霰，溜密应兼雨。\n寻灯靡靡飘，度隙斜斜舞。\n兴极还思剡，歌长重和楚。\n寂寞大音希，悠然向谁语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55758,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞世颂","author":"胡奎","text":"臣有一寸葵，托根空谷间。\n中有向日心，炳如九还丹。\n日照葵在地，葵倾日在天。\n由来忠义者，存殁无不然。\n臣心愿如葵，日照千万年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55759,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前有千万年","author":"胡奎","text":"前有千万年，不知是何物。\n后有千万年，变化安可测。\n河中龙马未生时，谁辨东西与南北。\n混沌死，七窍生。\n昆崙水源直到海，千流万派何由清。\n但见两轮日月东西走不息。\n人言火精与水银，锻冶红颜冻梨色。\n消磨绿发如星星，人生得意且为乐，何用空名留汗青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55760,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思三首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"脉脉有所思，泠泠寄哀弦。\n弦声久已绝，思君聆我弹。\n君情与妾意，忧乐转指间。\n幸随南风调，流响九嶷山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55761,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思三首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"落叶随风飞，欲归在何时。\n人生千里不得会，空向天涯歌所思。\n黄陵女儿泣湘月，苍梧鸣凤千年别。\n弹折秋风五十弦，妾貌如花命如叶。\n青猿夜啼三峡长，望美人兮良可伤。\n回雁峰前有来使，愿寄一书还故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55762,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思三首 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"所思向何方，所思今有所。\n食蓼不知辛，食檗不知苦。\n惟有所思愁杀人，蓼檗不能如苦辛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55763,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长相思四首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"长相思，千万里。\n相思如车下轮，相思如江中水。\n江中之水朝暮流，车下之轮何日休。\n胡不斫车轮，塞江水。\n车不能行水不流，世上相思何时已。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55764,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长相思四首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"长相思，路遥遥。\n相思如大江水，相思如杨柳条。\n杨柳条长尚可剪，大江水流不可断。\n长相思，深复深。\n平原莫绣五色线，子期莫铸双南金。\n人生知己古亦少，相思之心向谁道。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55765,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长相思四首 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"长相思，江悠悠。\n洞庭木落三湘秋。\n梦中不识别时路，九嶷云黯苍梧树。\n翠华南去不复还，双娥洒泪愁空山。\n五十哀弦雏凤语，鹧鸪啼处斑斑雨。\n长相思，思转深。\n请以白玉璞，琢出相思心。\n三湘之水东入海，相思之心终不改。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55766,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长相思四首 其四","author":"胡奎","text":"三年不见郎，万里梦他乡。\n江水直到海，寸心如许长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55767,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思君恩","author":"胡奎","text":"君恩深似海，君德浩如天。\n岁岁流红日，山呼亿万年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55768,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千里思","author":"胡奎","text":"五里复十里一，日不见心萦纡。\n何况千里别十，年五年不得书。\n君如天上云我，如水中泥云在。\n青霄泥在水相，思千里不相知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55769,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静夜思","author":"胡奎","text":"出门月色白如霜，静夜所思思断肠。\n有美人兮天一方，碧云迢迢河汉长。\n河汉长，不可越。\n但有一寸心，含情托明月。\n明月照人心不移，静夜所思谁得知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55770,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思归引","author":"胡奎","text":"寄声托明月，为我照家乡。\n十年不得归，今夕在路傍。\n路傍杨柳树，犹记来时路。\n越鸟恋南巢，燕鸿怀北度。\n去来南北无了期，人生莫作杨花飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55771,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长歌引","author":"胡奎","text":"短歌歌不足，长歌断复续。\n六龙之车海上来，千秋万古无停毂。\n碾雪推霜入镜中，坐见绿发如飞蓬。\n满堂窈窕春花红，长歌一曲歌未终，西陵陇树生秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55772,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋梦引","author":"胡奎","text":"井乌啼月银床冷，辘轳声断青丝绠。\n美人梦逐綵云飞，鹦䳇隔窗呼不醒。\n小鬟临镜双盘鸦，熏笼火暖篆烟斜。\n一寸芳心化胡蝶，飞来自采芙蓉花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55773,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"走马引","author":"胡奎","text":"千金买骏骨，五花散春云。\n章台杨柳陌，醉蹋落花春。\n烽烟四边静，宝玦腰间冷。\n寄谢少年人，男儿当惜身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55774,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"估客乐","author":"胡奎","text":"今日采石酒，明日广陵花。\n大帆随处泊，终岁不思家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55775,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫中乐","author":"胡奎","text":"初日上蓬莱，平明玉殿开。\n春风双凤琯，吹下世间来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55776,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绿水曲","author":"胡奎","text":"绿水何盈盈，方舟出兰渚。\n美人临清流，相期拾翠羽。\n翠羽不可拾，春波荡人心。\n人心如绿水，谁能知浅深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55777,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲三首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"江上水生蒲叶短，白沙晴卧凫鹥暖。\n木兰舟上紫云娘，笑入荷花羞见郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55778,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲三首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"水痕渐绿蒲芽短，雪消沙浦双凫煖。\n一夜鹅黄著柳枝，春愁暗逐春潮满。\n江上蒲帆鸟翼张，船头槌鼓出回塘。\n吴中女儿不解饮，呼酒隔帘催劝郎。\n并州剪刀金两股，不剪人间别离苦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55779,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲三首 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"湘云剪舞衣，楚月裁歌扇。\n荡舟莲叶深，羞与郎相见。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55780,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上曲三首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"春江水深蒲叶短，双凫交颈晴沙暖。\n青裙女儿木兰舟，白苧歌回花满头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55781,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上曲三首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"郎乘木兰舟，说道长干去。\n长干好女儿，留郎再三住。\n郎留岂不好，妾思令人老。\n郎心生蒺藜，不如女萝草。\n妾有一掬泪，洒向大江流。\n愿为西北风，吹转郎船头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55782,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上曲三首 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"蒲叶何短短，潮来江水满。\n岂无金错刀，割水水不断。\n山下蘼芜草，江边杜若花。\n采芳思寄远，游子隔天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55783,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江皋曲","author":"胡奎","text":"日暮清江上，临流采白蘋。\n微波将远意，寄与弄珠人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55784,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江曲","author":"胡奎","text":"清江水深蒲叶短，野凫双浴春波煖。\n吴宫女儿白苧歌，一曲春风吹不断。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55785,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春波曲","author":"胡奎","text":"新妇矶头雨，小姑山下云。\n无情江上水，总是别离痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55786,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金井曲","author":"胡奎","text":"井上青丝绠，年深石有痕。\n石痕犹不灭，况是感君恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55787,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大堤曲","author":"胡奎","text":"朝看堤上花，暮折堤上柳。\n相送大堤人，同倾大堤酒。\n酒酣蹋歌去，留郎堤上住。\n翻翻白马蹄，草绿无寻处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55788,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大道曲","author":"胡奎","text":"将军紫罗襦，燕坐城南陌。\n手拨紫檀槽，市中人不识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55789,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横塘曲","author":"胡奎","text":"妾家横塘口，门前种杨柳。\n春风吹舞腰，劝饮桃花酒。\n垂杨千万缕，下蘸横塘水。\n何事织离愁，春风吹不起。\n塘上谁家女，红裳白雪衣。\n采菱愁日晚，相待月明时。\n妾家住横塘，郎过须下马。\n手把珊瑚鞭，挂在垂杨下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55790,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凉州曲","author":"胡奎","text":"曾闻一斗酒，换得凉州牧。\n寄语远征人，莫唱凉州曲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55791,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"越城曲","author":"胡奎","text":"尝胆不知苦，捧心徒自颦。\n年年江水碧，愁杀浣纱人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55792,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城傍曲","author":"胡奎","text":"乌啼城上头，枕戈明月下。\n十年不得归，愿放华阳马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55793,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城门曲","author":"胡奎","text":"城头乌夜啼，月落少城西。\n夜半传军令，天明祭大旗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55794,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖中曲","author":"胡奎","text":"外湖湖水浊，里湖湖水清。\n妾不爱浊水，长向里湖行。\n手折芙蓉花，佳期碧云远。\n临水照蛾眉，盈盈愁日晚。\n日晚当奈何，湖中莲刺多。\n回舟荡桨去，莫唱采莲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55795,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天河曲","author":"胡奎","text":"天河之水向西流，双星夜夜当南楼。\n机中细织云锦字，美人不来生远愁。\n日夕河边待灵鹊，玉宇高寒露花落。\n愁心飞绕金井阑，辘轳牵断青丝索。\n灵槎一去秋冥冥，白榆千年那得青。\n天上回波还入海，东西相望心不改。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55796,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕曲","author":"胡奎","text":"妾在河东郎在西，妾秉机杼郎扶犁。\n夫田秋来不收谷，妾织锦云空满轴。\n一年一度寄郎衣，妾抱苦辛郎不知。\n今宵河畔一相见，风露无声乌鹊飞。\n乌鹊飞来莫飞去，借尔河东白榆树。\n树头结巢生子孙，不愁填河河水浑。\n百年三万六千日，今日谁云逢七七。\n人言织女嫁牵牛，灵鹊作桥天上头。\n妾是河东天帝女，郎司天田妾机杼。\n年年不敢误秋期，愿田有黍机有丝。\n丝能煖人黍能饱，妾亦何心频赐巧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55797,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜夜曲","author":"胡奎","text":"夜夜望明月，初若蛾眉弯。\n夜夜望明月，今如白玉盘。\n玉盘有时缺，蛾眉愁万结。\n月照闺中人，如何有离别。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55798,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜长曲","author":"胡奎","text":"金虬无声银箭缓，清夜何长昼何短。\n七星斜挂少城西，群乌叫月霜花满。\n铜盘煖蜡绛纱明，胡蝶梦寒龟甲屏。\n三尺床头白鹇尾，五更又逐鸡声起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55799,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜曲 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"绛河冻合白如霜，北斗挂树天苍苍。\n美人裁衣金剪冷，梦入梨云吹不醒。\n玉关迢迢南燕飞，灯花喜报行人归。\n行人不归花自落，月满城头夜吹角。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55800,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜曲 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"玉河回天冻光白，流云作冰飞不得。\n铜龙嘶寒漏声涩，七星离离挂城北。\n美人罗袜妒铅霜，兰烟唤香归洞房。\n何人一笛关山月，吹落梅花满城雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55801,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜曲 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"铜龙嘶寒漏声涩，夜半氍毹霜气入。\n冻蜡凝膏不作花，地炉火煖麒麟泣。\n酸风射入如箭急，燕律吹春竟何及。\n平明起视三足乌，红盆刷羽冰花湿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55802,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜曲怀二子","author":"胡奎","text":"城头乌啼寒夜长，北斗挂树天苍苍。\n展转不寐意徬徨，我思二子如凤凰。\n大儿读书不下堂，小儿写字能成行。\n我欲挟子翱且翔，手挥鸣弦发清商。\n侧身西望千仞冈，令人怀思不能忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55803,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"湖中女儿眉黛秋，采莲日日唱吴讴。\n何如生长玉井水，同擢仙人一叶舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55804,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"昨日采莲花，今日采莲子。\n贱妾比红衣，宁教抱香死。\n溪上采芙蓉，兰舟荡晚风。\n叶如郎意薄，花似妾颜红。\n采花莫临水，水深清见底。\n水有见底时，郎心隔千里。\n一去不思家，秋风吹若耶。\n只愁霜露重，妾貌不如花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55805,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折荷曲","author":"胡奎","text":"折荷莫折茎，中有千万丝。\n秋风吹不断，总是长相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55806,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"结杨柳曲","author":"胡奎","text":"千结江上柳，万结离人心。\n千结与万结，何如结衣襟。\n结襟尚可解，结心终不改。\n初结明月环，再结同心带。\n带以结绸缪，环以结欢爱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55807,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花游曲","author":"胡奎","text":"东阑杏花雨，袅袅寒食烟。\n相期洛阳陌，斗草赌金钱。\n白玉装车轴，珊瑚作马鞭。\n章台年少子，走马绿杨边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55808,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槟榔曲","author":"胡奎","text":"与郎相别时，槟榔高过屋。\n妾有回文锦字诗，为郎翻作槟榔曲。\n绿窗沈沈春昼閒，金盘钿合罗两鬟。\n苦心一寸谁解识，中含血泪红斑斑。\n昨梦郎归采蒌叶，丹髓凝春霞满颊。\n愿封珠唾寄蛮笺，郎若见时还念妾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55809,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绿珠曲","author":"胡奎","text":"郎有百斛珠，妾有一寸心。\n宁甘坠楼死，花落故园深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55810,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家曲","author":"胡奎","text":"门前一雨秧田绿，柘叶重重覆茅屋。\n今岁篱傍笋最多，南风一夜吹成竹。\n趁煖吴蚕已上山，缫车声动水车閒。\n幸喜村深无虎过，柴门终夜不曾关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55811,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒿里曲","author":"胡奎","text":"蒿里曲，春草绿，人生百年如转烛。\n石家美人双翠蛾，尊前妙舞扬清歌。\n一朝艳骨化黄土，富贵浮云可奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55812,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞曲","author":"胡奎","text":"将军乌角弓，壮士远从戎。\n剑倚燕云白，旗翻汉日红。\n雪窖数行泪，天山三箭弓。\n铙歌应有曲，报捷未央宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55813,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼曲","author":"胡奎","text":"今夜凭高望，青天月色多。\n入窗风露冷，开户看星河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55814,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎客曲","author":"胡奎","text":"陈绮席，进华觞，主人临轩客上堂。\n绮席陈，瑶觞进，清歌缓舞情无尽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55815,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"携手曲","author":"胡奎","text":"携手复携手，携手杏花前。\n白玉装车轴，黄金铸马鞭。\n容华易消歇，流光若逝川。\n寄言贵游子，欢娱当少年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55816,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣衣曲","author":"胡奎","text":"去年捣衣郎有书，今年捣衣郎在途。\n手悬双杵不敢下，只恐梦惊堂上姑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55817,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]